{"availability":"available","full":"HolmesGPT/holmesgpt","name":"holmesgpt","description":"SRE Agent - CNCF Sandbox Project","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":3513,"forks":513,"created":"2024-05-30T13:27:10Z","updated":"2026-10-06T14:46:44Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://holmesgpt.dev/","topics":["aiops","chatbot","chatops","devops","devops-tools","incident","incident-management","incident-response","jira","kubernetes","llm","llm-agent","llm-framework","llms","monitoring","observability","prometheus","site-reliability-engineering","slack","sre"],"demo":"https://www.loom.com/share/afcd81444b1a4adfaa0bbe01c37a4847","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:42:43.178Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:42:43.178Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:42:43.178Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:34.657Z","stars":3503,"forks":513},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:42:43.178Z","stars":3513,"forks":513}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Most AI agents are great at troubleshooting problems, but still need a human to notice something is wrong and trigger an investigation. Operator mode fixes that — HolmesGPT runs in the background 24/7, spots problems before your customers notice, and messages you in Slack with the fix. Connect the GitHub integration and it can even open PRs to fix what it finds.","While the operator itself runs in Kubernetes, health checks can query any data source Holmes is connected to — VMs, cloud services, databases, SaaS platforms, and more."],"features":["Deployment verification — Deploy a health check alongside your app to verify the new version is healthy","Scheduled health checks — Continuously monitor services and catch regressions automatically","Petabyte-scale data: Server-side filtering, JSON tree traversal, and tool output transformers keep large payloads out of context windows","Memory-safe execution: Per-tool memory limits, streaming large results to disk, and automatic output budgeting prevent OOM kills when querying large observability datasets","Deep integrations: Prometheus, Grafana, Datadog, Kubernetes, and many more—plus any REST API"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HolmesGPT/holmesgpt/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"e3a71a01ebd78830efd322b1576fd672fab486415826d253c4bde8ce775bf05c","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:34.807Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:34.807Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Most AI agents are great at troubleshooting problems, but still need a human to notice something is wrong and trigger an investigation. Operator mode fixes that — HolmesGPT runs in the background 24/7, spots problems before your customers notice, and messages you in Slack with the fix. Connect the GitHub integration and it can even open PRs to fix what it finds.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HolmesGPT/holmesgpt/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Read the LLM Providers documentation to learn how to set up your LLM API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HolmesGPT/holmesgpt/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e3a71a01ebd78830efd322b1576fd672fab486415826d253c4bde8ce775bf05c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HolmesGPT/holmesgpt/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:34.807Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T07:46:49Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HolmesGPT/holmesgpt/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T12:22:21.512Z","hash":"e3a71a01ebd78830efd322b1576fd672fab486415826d253c4bde8ce775bf05c","originalBytes":17033,"storedBytes":17033,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["mcp","holmesgpt","query","data","logs","any","kubernetes","health","alerts","cloud","azure","cli","diagnostics","documentation","issues","runbooks","status","community","events","fetch","how","llm","metrics","only","problems","prometheus","providers","resources","ro